          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holo 不太有把握的总结，确认后才会用于回答" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Summaries Holo is less confident about will only be used for answers after your confirmation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holo 不太有把握的總結，確認後才會用於回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holo 从你的记录里总结出了下面这些。点「对」或「不对」就好，确认后 Holo 回答会更准。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holo has summarized the following from your records. Just tap 'Right' or 'Wrong'—your confirmations will make Holo's answers more accurate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holo 從你的記錄裡總結出了下面這些。點「對」或「不對」就好，確認後 Holo 回答會更準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holo 会自动为想法打标签、归主题。不合适的建议点 ✗ 即可，不管它也没关系。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holo automatically tags and categorizes thoughts. If a suggestion isn't right, just tap ✗, or you can leave it alone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holo 會自動為想法打標籤、歸主題。不合適的建議點 ✗ 即可，不管它也沒關係。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holo 参考了 %lld 条已记住的信息" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holo referenced %lld remembered pieces of information"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Holo 參考了 %lld 條已記住的資訊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HOLO 只读取你的健康数据，用于展示三环进度和生成生活洞察；不会写入 Apple Health，也不会上传原始健康记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HOLO only reads your health data to display ring progress and generate life insights. It never writes to Apple Health or uploads raw health records."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HOLO 只讀取你的健康資料，用於展示三環進度和生成生活洞察；不會寫入 Apple Health，也不會上傳原始健康記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
