    },
    "你的个人数据助理。帮你记录生活、安排事情，并慢慢看见自己的变化。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your personal data assistant. It helps you log life, organize things, and gradually see your own changes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的個人資料助理。幫你記錄生活、安排事情，並慢慢看見自己的變化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的每条记录都会自动汇到这里，按日、周、月回看生活；右侧「洞察」是 Holo 对你的理解档案。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All your records automatically gather here—review life by day, week, or month. On the right, \"Insight\" is Holo's profile of you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的每條記錄都會自動匯到這裡，按日、周、月回看生活；右側「洞察」是 Holo 對你的理解檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的记录" : {
      "localizations" : {
