            "value" : "你的記憶設定或相關記錄有更新，重新提問生成新方案即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你睡眠接近目标时，第二天任务完成率通常更稳定。今晚优先保住睡眠环。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When your sleep is close to target, next-day task completion tends to be steadier. Prioritize closing your sleep ring tonight."
