    "勾选你认可的项：优先结果会建为目标，行动卡会创建对应的任务或习惯。你决定接受哪些——不勾的就是拒绝，拒绝会帮我下次做得更好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check the ones you agree with: top results become Goals, action cards create Tasks or Habits. You decide what to accept—unchecked means rejected, and rejection helps me do better next time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "勾選你認可的項：優先結果會建為目標，行動卡會建立對應的任務或習慣。你決定接受哪些——不勾的就是拒絕，拒絕會幫我下次做得更好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾选后创建为目标" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Check to create as Goal"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "勾選後建立為目標"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾选后才在 Holo 展示、供 AI 读取" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only checked items are shown in Holo and read by AI"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "勾選後才在 Holo 展示、供 AI 讀取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾选的日历会显示在 Holo 日历页；对话与周规划时 AI 也只读取这些日历来安排时间。日程数据仅在本机与当次 AI 请求中使用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Checked calendars appear on the Holo Calendar page; AI also reads only these calendars for scheduling during Chat and Weekly Plan. Schedule data is used only on this device and for the current AI request."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "勾選的日曆會顯示在 Holo 日曆頁；對話與周規劃時 AI 也只讀取這些日曆來安排時間。日程資料僅在本機與當次 AI 請求中使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾选的日历可在 Holo 中查看；对话与周规划时 AI 也会读取这些日历来安排时间。日程数据仅在本机与当次 AI 请求中使用。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Checked calendars can be viewed in Holo; AI also reads these calendars for scheduling during Chat and Weekly Plan. Schedule data is used only on this device and for the current AI request."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "勾選的日曆可在 Holo 中檢視；對話與周規劃時 AI 也會讀取這些日曆來安排時間。日程資料僅在本機與當次 AI 請求中使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
