    "已跳过：不计收支 %lld 条（零钱通/理财等）· 非成功状态 %lld 条（退款/关闭等）。退款不会自动冲减此前导入的原交易。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skipped: %lld not counted as income/expense (e.g., change fund, investments) · %lld non-successful (e.g., refunds, closed). Refunds won't offset previously imported transactions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
