    "开启" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enable"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，Holo 会把这条想法及匹配标签所需的信息发送给 AI 服务生成标签；想法和标签仍由你的设备保存，Holo 不为这项功能建立云端资料库。关闭后新想法不再自动请求 AI，历史标签不受影响；你仍可对单条想法点「重新整理」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, Holo will send this thought and the information needed to match tags to the AI service to generate tags; thoughts and tags are still stored on your device, and Holo does not create a cloud database for this feature. When disabled, new thoughts will no longer automatically request AI, and historical tags are unaffected; you can still tap \"Reorganize\" on individual thoughts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，Holo 會把這條想法及匹配標籤所需的資訊傳送給 AI 服務生成標籤；想法和標籤仍由你的裝置儲存，Holo 不為這項功能建立雲端資料庫。關閉後新想法不再自動請求 AI，歷史標籤不受影響；你仍可對單條想法點「重新整理」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，仅在你使用相关 AI 功能时，你的问题，以及完成该功能所需的财务、习惯、待办、想法和健康摘要或语音片段，会经 Holo 后端发送给第三方 AI 或语音服务处理。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, only when you use related AI features, your questions and the financial, habit, to-do, thought, and health summaries or voice clips needed to complete those features will be sent via Holo's backend to third-party AI or voice services for processing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，僅在你使用相關 AI 功能時，你的問題，以及完成該功能所需的財務、習慣、待辦、想法和健康摘要或語音片段，會經 Holo 後端傳送給第三方 AI 或語音服務處理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，每天早上的通知会直接告诉你今天有几件事、最要紧的是哪件；当天没有待办时保持安静，不会打扰。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, the morning notification will tell you how many tasks you have today and which is the most important; it stays quiet when there are no to-dos for the day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，每天早上的通知會直接告訴你今天有幾件事、最要緊的是哪件；當天沒有待辦時保持安靜，不會打擾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，跟随汇总的习惯会在每天的汇总时间收到一条提醒；关闭后，只有单独设了时间的习惯按自己的时间提醒。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, habits that follow the summary will receive a reminder at the daily summary time; when disabled, only habits with their own set times will remind at those times."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，跟隨彙總的習慣會在每天的彙總時間收到一條提醒；關閉後，只有單獨設了時間的習慣按自己的時間提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
