    "检测到 %lld 条数据与清空后新产生的数据疑似重复（同日同额/同名等）。默认跳过这些条目、保留现有数据；如确认要恢复，请单独勾选。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Detected %lld entries that may be duplicates of data created after the clear (e.g., same day/amount/name). These will be skipped by default, keeping existing data. If you confirm they should be restored, select them individually."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檢測到 %lld 條資料與清空後新產生的資料疑似重複（同日同額/同名等）。預設跳過這些條目、保留現有資料；如確認要恢復，請單獨勾選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检测到 %lld 条疑似重复数据将跳过，其余 %lld 条将恢复。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld potentially duplicate entries will be skipped; the remaining %lld will be restored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "檢測到 %lld 條疑似重複資料將跳過，其餘 %lld 條將恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
