    "每条想法会产生 ≤3 个标签建议，可在详情页确认或拒绝。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each Thought generates up to 3 tag suggestions, which you can confirm or reject on the detail page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每條想法會產生 ≤3 個標籤建議，可在詳情頁確認或拒絕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每条都标明会记多久：近期观察会随数据变化淡出，长期记忆只保留跨周期规律或你确认的重要事实。健康与敏感类记忆仅保存在本设备、不上传 iCloud，卸载重装后这部分不会恢复。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each entry indicates how long it will be kept: recent observations fade as data changes, while long-term memories retain only cross-cycle patterns or important facts you confirm. Health and sensitive memories are stored only on this device and are not uploaded to iCloud; they will not be restored after uninstalling and reinstalling."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每條都標明會記多久：近期觀察會隨資料變化淡出，長期記憶只保留跨週期規律或你確認的重要事實。健康與敏感類記憶僅儲存在本裝置、不上傳 iCloud，解除安裝重灌後這部分不會恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每次到期记录一笔每期金额，未来期次不会提前入账。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each time a period is due, the amount for that period is recorded; future periods are not entered in advance."
