      }
    },
    "订阅会自动续费，除非在当前订阅期结束前至少 24 小时关闭自动续订。续订将在到期前 24 小时内按对应方案扣款。可在「系统设置 › Apple ID › 订阅」中管理或取消。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Subscriptions auto-renew unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Renewal will be charged within 24 hours before expiration. Manage or cancel in Settings › Apple ID › Subscriptions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "訂閱會自動續費，除非在當前訂閱期結束前至少 24 小時關閉自動續訂。續訂將在到期前 24 小時內按對應方案扣款。可在「系統設定 › Apple ID › 訂閱」中管理或取消。"
          }
        }
      }
