    "超支多少，下个月的预算额度就扣多少（最低扣到 0）；省下的钱不累积，下月不超支就自动恢复原额度。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any overspending reduces next month's budget by the same amount (down to a minimum of 0). Money saved does not carry over; if you don't overspend next month, the original budget is automatically restored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超支多少，下個月的預算額度就扣多少（最低扣到 0）；省下的錢不累積，下月不超支就自動恢復原額度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
