    "这里会切换服务端真实权益与独立验收额度。\"跟随购买\"会恢复账号的真实购买状态，不会被验收数据覆盖。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This toggles between real server-side benefits and independent acceptance quota. \"Follow Purchase\" will restore the account's real purchase status and won't be overwritten by acceptance data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這裡會切換服務端真實權益與獨立驗收額度。\"跟隨購買\"會恢復帳號的真實購買狀態，不會被驗收資料覆蓋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里只保存数量、阶段和拒绝代码，不保存模型原文、记忆正文或证据摘要。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only counts, stages, and refusal codes are saved here; model text, memory content, and evidence summaries are not saved."
          }
